    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">2. The Service</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop is a personal wellness tool that lets you log meals (including
    photo-based analysis), track daily nutrition and trends, import health metrics,
    record symptoms, set nutrition goals, and receive reminders. It is provided for
    general informational and educational purposes only.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">3. Not medical advice</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop does <strong>not</strong> provide medical, nutritional, or health-care
    advice, diagnosis, or treatment, and is not a substitute for a qualified
    professional. Nutrition figures, inflammation and goal scores, and suggestions are
    estimates and educational signals only. Always consult a physician or qualified
    provider before making decisions about your diet or health, and never disregard or
    delay professional advice because of something in the Service. NouriLoop is not a
    HIPAA-covered entity.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">4. AI-generated estimates</h2>
    <p>Food-photo analysis, nutrition values, and goal narratives are generated in part
    by automated and AI systems (including third-party AI providers) and may be
