        <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to cancel at any time, or
        <strong>HELP</strong> for help; you may also turn SMS off in Settings.</li>
        <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
        <li>Consent to SMS is not a condition of using NouriLoop (email delivery is always
