    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">16. Subscription and billing</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop offers a free tier plus two paid subscription tiers, billed monthly through
    our payment processor, Stripe:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Free</strong> — core logging with a monthly limit on AI analyses.</li>
        <li><strong>Loop</strong> — ${{ subscription_price('loop') }}/month. AI features run on
